          built for real operating conditions.
        </p>
        <a
          href="#work"
          class="pointer-events-auto mt-8 inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 text-sm font-medium text-black transition-transform duration-150 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#7dd3fc]"
